WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.200
This is an observed-time
framework for an API pilot.

00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:07.520
Start by recording the current workflow.
Establish the required foundations,

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.680
run comparable work, and repeat the checks
before deciding what can expand.

00:00:11.860 --> 00:00:14.320
The windows shown are planning examples.

00:00:14.760 --> 00:00:19.120
A phase progresses when its environment,
data, virtualization and reviewer

00:00:19.175 --> 00:00:23.360
requirements are ready. Record
active effort and waiting separately.

00:00:23.536 --> 00:00:26.800
That makes delays visible
and prevents setup work

00:00:26.832 --> 00:00:30.240
from disappearing inside
an attractive productivity percentage.
